WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
Stop buying a new bike
because yours squeaks.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.620
First, find out
what's making the noise.

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.960
A loose rack and a worn chain

4
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.960
are different problems,
with different fixes.

5
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.200
Bring the bike in.

6
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.560
We'll check the source,
explain the repair,

7
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.900
and give you a quote
before we start.

8
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.080
Get an answer
before you buy an upgrade.
